# 📋 Issue: AI 助手回复异常 - 仅输出 `<blockquote/>`\n\n#### 1. 问题描述\n在使用 AI 助手进行辅助编程时，偶发性出现 AI 回复内容为空，仅输出一个 `<blockquote/>` 自闭合标签的情况。这导致无法获取预期的代码建议或问题解答，中断了正常的交互流程。\n\n#### 2. 复现步骤\n1. 在 IDE 中与 AI 助手进行对话交互。\n2. 输入指令或问题（具体触发关键词尚不明确，属于偶发跑象）。\n3. 观察 AI 的回复内容。\n\n#### 3. 实际结果\nAI 的回复仅包含字符串 `<blockquote/>`，无其他有效信息。\n\n#### 4. 环境信息\n- **OS**: macOS\n- **IDE**: Trae (3.5.21)\n- **模型**: Gemini-3-Pro-Preview (200k)\n#### 5. 附件/备注 \n- **出现频率**：间歇性/偶发\n- **影响程度**：阻碍正常开发流程，需要重试。\n\n***","closed_by":{"login":"quazion","id":49785128,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5Nzg1MTI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49785128?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quazion","html_url":"https://github.com/quazion","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quazion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quazion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quazion/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quazion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quazion/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quazion/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quazion/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quazion/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quazion/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2301/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2301/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3970604881","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2301#issuecomment-3970604881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2301","id":397060488